{"title":"专注命令与键位","summary":"新增命令「进入专注」、组合键 mod+shift+d 与专注布局预设","kind":"declarative","risk":"low","capabilities":["ui:command","ui:keymap","ui:layout"],"files":[{"path":".lumen-plugin.json","content":"{
  "id": "local.creator.template.keys",
  "name": {
    "zh": "专注快捷键",
    "en": "Focus shortcut"
  },
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "apiVersion": "1.0",
  "minAppVersion": "0.4.0",
  "kind": "declarative",
  "author": {
    "name": "LUMEN Creator"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "一个专注布局预设、一个命令与一个组合键。",
    "en": "A focus preset, a command, and a key combo."
  },
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "capabilities": [
    "ui:command",
    "ui:keymap",
    "ui:layout"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "layoutPresets": [
      {
        "id": "focus",
        "name": {
          "zh": "专注",
          "en": "Focus"
        },
        "apply": {
          "hideInspector": true,
          "railWidth": 216
        }
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "id": "focus-mode",
        "title": {
          "zh": "进入专注",
          "en": "Focus mode"
        },
        "category": "plugin",
        "action": {
          "kind": "applyLayoutPreset",
          "presetId": "focus"
        }
      }
    ],
    "keymap": [
      {
        "combo": "mod+shift+d",
        "commandId": "focus-mode"
      }
    ]
  }
}"}],"changes":[{"surface":"command","detail":"命令面板新增「进入专注」"},{"surface":"keymap","detail":"绑定 mod+shift+d（冲突需你确认）"},{"surface":"layout","detail":"应用「专注」预设：收起右栏"}],"trialNote":"按一下你刚设的键"}
